# Generated MAP-017 schema evidence. These contain no rows or credentials, but
# they do describe the full authorization model (RLS predicates, grants, function
# signatures and search_path config) and should not be committed casually.
# scripts/map016-evidence/vercel-env-inventory.json is deliberately tracked: it
# holds variable NAMES only and is referenced as MAP-016 evidence.
